Can't get you off my mind ♪

736
00:44:15.611 --> 00:44:16.445
Here we go!

737
00:44:17.572 --> 00:44:19.490
♪ Let's get lost tonight ♪

738
00:44:19.574 --> 00:44:22.160
♪ Let's get lost tonight ♪

739
00:44:22.243 --> 00:44:23.160
♪ Baby, you and ♪

740
00:44:23.244 --> 00:44:26.122
♪ I can't seem to get you off my mind ♪

741
00:44:26.205 --> 00:44:28.708
[Shawn] For this whole year
and most of your life,

742
00:44:28.791 --> 00:44:31.586
it feels like you've been
anticipating a show like this.

743
00:44:32.712 --> 00:44:35.715
You're standing in front of a crowd
of 50,000 people.

744
00:44:36.299 --> 00:44:38.676
And it feels completely surreal.

745
00:44:39.760 --> 00:44:42.180
It's like your feet are floating 
off the ground.

746
00:44:43.306 --> 00:44:45.808
It's kind of pure magic
from start to finish.

747
00:44:46.392 --> 00:44:50.396
♪ When you're high up above 
Or down below ♪

748
00:44:53.107 --> 00:44:57.236
♪ When you're too in love to let it go ♪

749
00:44:59.780 --> 00:45:04.952
♪ But if you never try
Then you'll never know ♪

750
00:45:05.661 --> 00:45:10.625
♪ Just what you're worth ♪

751
00:45:11.876 --> 00:45:13.794
Everybody all together. Here we go.

752
00:45:15.671 --> 00:45:22.178
-♪ 'Cause lights will... ♪
-♪ 'Cause lights will guide you home ♪

753
00:45:22.887 --> 00:45:28.351
♪ And ignite your bones ♪

754
00:45:29.393 --> 00:45:35.316
♪ And I will try to fix you ♪

755
00:45:37.318 --> 00:45:39.070
I love you so much. Thank you.

756
00:45:39.153 --> 00:45:41.072
[audience cheering loudly]

757
00:45:43.074 --> 00:45:47.536
[Shawn] I just felt like there was this
real sense of love in the room that night.

758
00:45:47.620 --> 00:45:51.165
Toronto, I love you so much
with all of my heart. Thank you.

759
00:45:51.249 --> 00:45:53.376
Thank you.
Thank you so much for having us.

760
00:46:19.360 --> 00:46:21.487
[people whooping]

761
