Oh, Shawn!

767
00:46:40.589 --> 00:46:42.591
[indistinct chatter]

768
00:46:43.342 --> 00:46:45.344
Nothing better than that, Shawn.

769
00:46:46.220 --> 00:46:49.473
-Oh, Shawn, I am so proud of you.
-Thank you.

770
00:46:49.557 --> 00:46:52.268
-You know me, I cry a lot.
-[laughing]

771
00:46:58.149 --> 00:47:00.359
-[women cheering]
-[woman] Shawn!

772
00:47:07.074 --> 00:47:08.367
Thank you!

773
00:47:09.744 --> 00:47:11.746
Are we in the right car?

774
00:47:12.371 --> 00:47:15.708
