-I have her vocals separate, too,

776
00:47:17.835 --> 00:47:20.254
so we can pull 'em down if we need to.

777
00:47:20.338 --> 00:47:21.922
-It's all over two.
-Yeah.

778
00:47:22.006 --> 00:47:24.341
