I kept playing this.

783
00:47:32.933 --> 00:47:35.144
[plays soothing progression]

784
00:47:44.779 --> 00:47:47.990
♪ Ooh, your body's like an ocean ♪

785
00:47:49.158 --> 00:47:51.160
♪ I'm devoted ♪

786
00:47:53.329 --> 00:47:55.915
♪ I'll do
I'll do it for you ♪

787
00:47:55.998 --> 00:47:58.417
♪ Run my hands around you ♪

788
00:47:58.501 --> 00:48:01.087
♪ Ooh, teach me how to ♪

789
00:48:01.170 --> 00:48:03.547
♪ Touch you, kiss, caress you 
And squeeze ♪

790
00:48:03.631 --> 00:48:05.383
♪ Teach me how to love ♪

791
00:48:05.466 --> 00:48:06.467
Something like that.

792
00:48:06.550 --> 00:48:09.178
[all] ♪ Ooh, teach me how to ♪

793
00:48:09.261 --> 00:48:11.680
♪ Touch you, tease
Caress you and please you ♪

794
00:48:11.764 --> 00:48:14.016
♪ Teach me how to love ♪

795
00:48:14.100 --> 00:48:16.519
-Yeah.
-To go from the unison to the harmony,

796
00:48:16.602 --> 00:48:18.145
I'd be like, "Can't do it."

797
00:48:18.229 --> 00:48:19.855
-[chuckling]
-I had to repeat it.

798
00:48:19.939 --> 00:48:23.526
Most of the time I have to play
the piano part into the track.

799
00:48:23.609 --> 00:48:25.903
♪ How to love ♪

800
00:48:25.986 --> 00:48:28.155
-♪ How to love ♪
-[woman] Mmm-hmm.

801
00:48:28.239 --> 00:48:29.615
♪ How to love ♪

802
00:48:29.698 --> 00:48:32.201
I might come in there with you
'cause it's fun.

803
00:48:32.284 --> 00:48:35.746
♪ Teach me, teach me, teach me
How to love ♪

804
00:48:36.497 --> 00:48:38.749
♪ How to love ♪

805
00:48:38.833 --> 00:48:41.502
♪ How to love ♪

806
00:48:42.044 --> 00:48:45.840
♪ Teach me, teach me, teach me
How to love ♪

807
00:48:45.923 --> 00:48:46.924
Let's go once more.

808
00:48:48.050 --> 00:48:50.261
Go again. 
I'm gonna take a listen for a sec.

809
00:48:50.344 --> 00:48:52.763
'Cause we have
this individual line function...

810
00:48:52.847 --> 00:48:56.517
[on recording] ♪ Teach me, teach me
Teach me how to love ♪

811
00:48:57.101 --> 00:48:58.269
♪ How to love ♪

812
00:48:58.352 --> 00:49:00.438
[vocalizing]

813
00:49:01.021 --> 00:49:01.856
Yeah.

814
00:49:02.481 --> 00:49:04.191
[Shawn] And we're missing the...

815
