♪ They always say your name ♪

843
00:50:48.295 --> 00:50:51.757
♪ Before you go home
I should let you know ♪

844
00:50:51.840 --> 00:50:54.260
♪ I'm so glad that you came ♪

845
00:50:55.135 --> 00:50:59.557
♪ I know that we went late
No, no ♪

846
