♪ But look up at the stars ♪

847
00:51:03.978 --> 00:51:07.064
♪ They're like pieces of art ♪

848
00:51:07.940 --> 00:51:11.068
♪ Floating above the planet ♪

849
00:51:12.486 --> 00:51:16.282
♪ You know we've come so far ♪

850
00:51:16.365 --> 00:51:19.660
♪ The universe is ours ♪

851
00:51:20.160 --> 00:51:24.248
♪ And I'm not gonna let you down ♪

852
00:51:25.708 --> 00:51:29.044
I wonder what else I can do.
[sighs]

853
00:51:29.128 --> 00:51:31.672
Maybe I'm doing
a little too much on stage.

854
00:51:31.755 --> 00:51:33.048
[Cez Darke] Maybe.

855
00:51:33.799 --> 00:51:36.719
Maybe calm down a bit.
You've also added another song.

856
00:51:36.802 --> 00:51:37.761
Two songs.

857
00:51:37.845 --> 00:51:39.221
Two songs, basically.

858
00:51:39.305 --> 00:51:41.307
-And the medley's longer.
-Yeah.

859
00:51:41.390 --> 00:51:42.808
So you're working harder.

860
00:51:42.891 --> 00:51:44.518
[audience cheering]

861
00:51:44.602 --> 00:51:46.854
