866
00:52:11.837 --> 00:52:12.921
Beautiful!

867
00:52:13.380 --> 00:52:15.883
♪ I'm tripping over myself... ♪
[voice cutting off]

868
00:52:20.679 --> 00:52:22.056
[audience cheering]

869
